\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Convex roof of the linear entropy $S_L=1-\tr \rho _A^2$ for the Horodecki $2\times 4$ family $\rho _a$. Lines: lower bounds at the levels $(k,m)$ of the simplified hierarchy; from $k=2$ on they coincide, including $(2,4)$ (green, dotted). Markers: upper bounds from the decomposition extracted from the SDP solution at $k=m=3$ (orange diamonds) and from HJW gradient descent (black crosses).}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
